Text: Basic Law of the Macao Special Administrative Region of the People's Republic of China (Chinese text), as published on the website of the Legislative Assembly of the Macao SAR (https://www.al.gov.mo/zh-hant/basic-law.html). The site states no licence; the official legal text is reproduced for reference with attribution to the publisher.

Text of the codes (Portuguese): Boletim Oficial da Região Administrativa Especial de Macau, published by the Imprensa Oficial (https://bo.io.gov.mo/). No licence is stated; the official legal texts are reproduced for reference with attribution to the publisher.

